cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite it
  using the metadata in this file, and cite the TSE electoral
  data you analysed as a separate data source.
type: software
title: "BRElections.jl: a Julia interface to Brazilian electoral open data (TSE)"
abstract: >-
  Julia package for Brazil's public electoral data, published by the Tribunal
  Superior Eleitoral (TSE): automatic download of the open-data ZIP files with
  retries and atomic writes, a portable local cache, ZIP extraction with
  on-the-fly ISO-8859-1 to UTF-8 transcoding, chunk-based multithreaded CSV
  reading with column selection and row filtering applied during import, and
  type conversion tuned to TSE conventions (dates, #NULO#/#NE# sentinels, and
  identifier columns kept as String so leading zeros survive).
